{"id":"level-up-2026-10-14","name":"2026-10-14 每日卡片","project":"level-up-cards","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/tree/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45","sentences":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1301","en":"The novel's sluttish housekeeper leaves dirty plates in every room.","zh":"小说里那个邋遢的女管家把脏盘子留得到处都是。","note":"sluttish · 懒惰的， 邋遢的； 放荡的 · sluttish habits","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1302","en":"We examined a thin onion skin under a microscope.","zh":"我们用显微镜观察了一层薄薄的洋葱表皮。","note":"microscope · 显微镜 · under a microscope","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1303","en":"A higher price does not necessarily guarantee better sound quality.","zh":"价格更高并不一定保证音质更好。","note":"necessarily · 必要地； 必然地 · not necessarily","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1304","en":"The panel interviewed each suitable candidate for the research position.","zh":"评审小组面试了这份研究岗位的每位合适候选人。","note":"candidate · 候选人， 候补者； 申请求职者； 报考者 · a suitable candidate","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1305","en":"A postgraduate student helped us locate the original survey data.","zh":"一名研究生帮助我们找到了原始调查数据。","note":"postgraduate · 研究生 · a postgraduate student","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1306","en":"A temperature inversion trapped mist over the valley that morning.","zh":"那天早上，逆温现象使雾滞留在山谷上方。","note":"inversion · 倒置， 颠倒 · temperature inversion","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1307","en":"Her recorded instructions remained intelligible despite the noise outside.","zh":"尽管外面很吵，她录下的指示仍然听得清楚。","note":"intelligible · 可理解的， 明白易懂的， 清楚的 · clearly intelligible","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1308","en":"Draw two parallel lines across the centre of the page.","zh":"在页面中央画两条平行线。","note":"parallel · 平行的；类似的，相对应的；并行的；可相比拟的事物，相似处；纬线；与…相似； 比得上 · parallel lines","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1309","en":"We thanked our hosts for their warm hospitality before leaving.","zh":"离开前，我们感谢了主人的热情款待。","note":"hospitality · 友好款待， 好客； 盛情； 招待礼节 · warm hospitality","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1310","en":"We rested under a tree to escape the scorching heat.","zh":"我们在树下休息，躲避酷热。","note":"scorching · 酷热的； 激烈的 · scorching heat","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1311","en":"The museum displayed a decompression chamber once used by divers.","zh":"博物馆展出了一间潜水员曾经使用的减压舱。","note":"decompression · 减压； 减压室 · decompression chamber","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1312","en":"Researchers traced the water-borne pollution to a factory upstream.","zh":"研究人员追查到这种经水传播的污染源于上游一家工厂。","note":"water-borne · 水运的， 水传播的， 饮水传染的 · water-borne pollution","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1313","en":"The festival provided a strong stimulus for the local economy.","zh":"这个节庆活动有力地刺激了当地经济。","note":"stimulus · 刺激， 促进 · a strong stimulus","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1314","en":"The station's confusing signs often bewilder visitors arriving at night.","zh":"车站令人困惑的标牌常让夜间到访的旅客不知所措。","note":"bewilder · 使迷惑， 使昏乱 · bewilder visitors","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1315","en":"She retired after thirty years with an unblemished safety record.","zh":"她退休时，已保持了三十年无事故的安全记录。","note":"unblemished · 无瑕疵的， 完好的 · an unblemished record","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1316","en":"A free shuttle connects the airport terminal with nearby hotels.","zh":"免费班车连接机场航站楼和附近的酒店。","note":"terminal · 末端的；终点，终端；终点站，航站楼 · airport terminal","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1317","en":"These details diminish in importance when we consider the wider problem.","zh":"当我们考虑更广泛的问题时，这些细节就显得不那么重要了。","note":"diminish · 减少； 降低； 贬低， 轻视 · diminish in importance","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1318","en":"Ticket sales managed to surpass our expectations within two days.","zh":"两天之内，门票销量就超过了我们的预期。","note":"surpass · 超过， 超越， 优于， 胜过； 超过…的界限， 非…所能办到 · surpass expectations","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1319","en":"Without fresh ideas, the discussion began to stagnate after lunch.","zh":"由于没有新想法，午饭后的讨论开始陷入停滞。","note":"stagnate · 停滞； 不发展 · begin to stagnate","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1320","en":"Her administrative duties include arranging meetings and maintaining staff records.","zh":"她的行政职责包括安排会议和维护员工记录。","note":"administrative · 管理的， 行政的 · administrative duties","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1321","en":"Students chose the evening course for various personal reasons.","zh":"学生们出于各种个人原因选择了这门晚间课程。","note":"various · 各种各样的； 不同的； 多方面的 · various reasons","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1322","en":"Please pay attention to the final step in this demonstration.","zh":"请注意这次演示的最后一个步骤。","note":"attention · 注意， 留心； 立正 · pay attention","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1323","en":"Teaching young children gave her a deep sense of personal fulfillment.","zh":"教年幼的孩子让她获得了深深的个人成就感。","note":"fulfillment · 履行； 实现 · personal fulfillment","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1324","en":"The editor refused to succumb to pressure from the sponsors.","zh":"编辑拒绝屈服于赞助方的压力。","note":"succumb · 屈服， 屈从； 死亡 · succumb to pressure","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1325","en":"The recipe requires powdered gelatin to help the dessert set.","zh":"这个食谱需要用明胶粉帮助甜点凝固。","note":"gelatin · 明胶 · powdered gelatin","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1326","en":"The photographs reveal the full extent of the storm damage.","zh":"这些照片揭示了暴风雨造成破坏的全部程度。","note":"extent · 范围； 面积； 广度， 长度； 程度 · the full extent","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1327","en":"The farmer will plough the lower field before planting barley.","zh":"农民将在种植大麦之前翻耕低处的那块田。","note":"plough · 犁；犁（地），耕（地） · plough a field","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1328","en":"Larger rooms cost more; conversely, smaller rooms are usually cheaper.","zh":"较大的房间费用更高；反过来，较小的房间通常更便宜。","note":"conversely · 相反地， 颠倒地 · conversely","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1329","en":"The diagram shows magma rising towards the Earth's surface.","zh":"这张示意图展示了岩浆向地表上升的过程。","note":"magma · 岩浆 · molten magma","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1330","en":"The scholarship programme aims to promote equity in higher education.","zh":"这项奖学金计划旨在促进高等教育公平。","note":"equity · 公平， 公正 · promote equity","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1331","en":"My father likes to solve a crossword after breakfast.","zh":"父亲喜欢在早餐后做一道纵横填字题。","note":"crossword · 纵横填字游戏 · solve a crossword","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1332","en":"The lecture explored the complex interrelationship between language and identity.","zh":"这场讲座探讨了语言与身份认同之间复杂的相互关系。","note":"interrelationship · 相互关联， 相互影响 · a complex interrelationship","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1333","en":"The new evidence led us to question our original assumption.","zh":"新证据使我们开始质疑最初的假设。","note":"assumption · 假定， 假设； 担任， 承担 · question an assumption","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1334","en":"Her monthly pension covers the rent and most household expenses.","zh":"她每月的养老金足以支付房租和大部分家庭开支。","note":"pension · 养老金， 抚恤金； 年金 · a monthly pension","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1335","en":"Please rank these proposals in order of their likely impact.","zh":"请按这些提案可能产生的影响给它们排序。","note":"rank · 排列；分等；等级； 军衔 · rank in order","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1336","en":"Buildings deteriorate quickly when owners neglect basic maintenance for years.","zh":"业主多年忽视基本维护，建筑物就会迅速破败。","note":"neglect · 忽视； 疏忽； 遗漏 · neglect maintenance","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1337","en":"The quiet reading room is a welcome addition to our library.","zh":"新添的安静阅览室很受我们图书馆读者欢迎。","note":"addition · 加， 增加 · a welcome addition","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1338","en":"We learned to surf during our holiday on the coast.","zh":"我们在海滨度假时学会了冲浪。","note":"surf · 冲浪 · learn to surf","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1339","en":"The observatory's exhibition includes information about cosmic dust and stars.","zh":"天文台的展览包括有关宇宙尘埃和恒星的信息。","note":"cosmic · 宇宙的 · cosmic dust","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1340","en":"A gang of thieves stole bicycles from the station.","zh":"一伙小偷偷走了车站的自行车。","note":"gang · 结成一伙；一帮 · a gang of thieves","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1341","en":"He used a small knife to carve a wooden bird.","zh":"他用一把小刀雕刻了一只木鸟。","note":"carve · 切； 雕刻 · carve a figure","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1342","en":"The poet uses metaphorical language to describe the changing seasons.","zh":"诗人用隐喻性的语言描写季节的变化。","note":"metaphorical · 隐喻的 · metaphorical language","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1343","en":"A thin veil of mist covered the lake at dawn.","zh":"黎明时，湖面笼罩着一层薄雾。","note":"veil · 面纱；遮蔽物；蒙着面纱； 掩饰 · a thin veil","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1344","en":"The revised design performed marginally better in our final test.","zh":"修改后的设计在我们的最终测试中表现略好一些。","note":"marginally · 稍微， 些微 · marginally better","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1345","en":"This woollen jumper may shrink in the wash, so handle it carefully.","zh":"这件羊毛衫洗涤时可能缩水，因此要小心处理。","note":"shrink · 收缩； 萎缩 · shrink in the wash","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1346","en":"The diagram shows a clear hierarchy of roles within the organisation.","zh":"这张图清晰地展示了组织内部职位的等级关系。","note":"hierarchy · 领导层； 层次， 等级 · a clear hierarchy","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1347","en":"The town's textile industry once employed most of its residents.","zh":"这个镇的纺织业曾雇用了大部分当地居民。","note":"textile · 纺织品 · textile industry","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1348","en":"Several walking trails allow visitors to explore the immediate locality.","zh":"几条步道让游客可以探索附近地区。","note":"locality · 位置； 地区 · the immediate locality","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1349","en":"A former teacher recognised me at the railway station.","zh":"以前的一位老师在火车站认出了我。","note":"former · 以前的；前者 · a former teacher","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:s1350","en":"Rumours about shortages triggered panic buying at several local supermarkets.","zh":"物资短缺的传言引发了几家当地超市的恐慌性抢购。","note":"panic · 恐慌的；惊慌失措；恐慌，惊惶 · panic buying","recordings":[]}],"words":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:w1301","en":"sluttish","zh":"懒惰的， 邋遢的； 放荡的","note":"英 /'slʌtɪʃ/ · 美 /'slʌtiʃ/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1301-uk-a77c65a2f867.mp3","text":"sluttish"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1301-us-5bdc4378f062.mp3","text":"sluttish"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:w1302","en":"microscope","zh":"显微镜","note":"英 /'maɪkrəskəup/ · 美 /'maɪkrəskop/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1302-uk-2d4d4f20a592.mp3","text":"microscope"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1302-us-be1595486baf.mp3","text":"microscope"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-14:w1303","en":"necessarily","zh":"必要地； 必然地","note":"英 /'nesəsərəli; ˌnesə'serəli/ · 美 /,nɛsə'sɛrəli/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/1303-uk-6e628b903d34.